Description: play the soundtrack with mpg123
 The release ships patchbay.mp3 (Patchbay, by Octothorp), the one-minute
 soundtrack of the demo, but the program does not play it. Start mpg123
 in the background when the demo begins and stop it at the end. The demo
 stays silent if mpg123 is not installed; --no-music disables the
 soundtrack.
